    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i can talk to people but it doesn't change the reality. the reality is that the person who could actually create something meaningful is gone. what's the point of trying to \"fix\" a person who isn't even there anymore? it just feels like i'm performing a role in a life i don't even own.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
